<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine July monthly inflation flat at 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine July monthly inflation flat at 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's monthly inflation was unchanged at 0.1 percent in July from June, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE CONSUMER PRICES   July 97   June 97   July 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (%) +0.1	+0.1	+0.1</p>
<p>Prices have risen 5.4 percent so far this year, compared to a rise of 25 percent for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The government has forecast annual inflation at 16-17 percent this year, after 29.7 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
